{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09056","headline":"寄中书刘舍人 · 韦应物","name":"寄中书刘舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云霄路竟别，中年迹暂同。\n比翼趋丹陛，连骑下南宫。\n佳咏邀清月，幽赏滞芳藂。\n迨予一出守，与子限西东。\n晨露方怆怆，离抱更忡忡。\n忽睹九天诏，秉纶归国工。\n玉座浮香气，秋禁散凉风。\n应向横门度，环佩杳玲珑。\n光辉恨未瞩，归思坐难通。\n苍苍松桂姿，想在掖垣中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}